{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>But if you remember me with you.</b> This indicates that your affection toward me will be such that you will mention me when it is well with you — when you find a fitting opportunity for this." "<b>And you shall mention me to Pharaoh.</b> Make me known — that I was in the house of the chief butler." "<b>And you shall bring me out.</b> Then you shall surely bring me out without doubt."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:00.866511796Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}